  "acceptedBounds": {
    "prepareOnly": "Separate exact G2, only necessary real auth200/session/security footprint, publicGET and defaultRO snapshots; no Main classification/replay, no Tax domainPOST. Initialize separate Tax15 metadata, retain failedTax14 and actualMain13, then complete facts/body/CAS/full ordered inventory STOP for review.",
    "effectModes": "Each closed-set/family input exact-bound to real prepared whole inventory and descriptor/body/scope. Persist verified+removed family before cursor advance; first unknown/fallback/wrong hit/partial stops later POSTs. Resume needs new exact recovery review. Commit-once is separately approved after closed FI; FI capability cannot normal-commit.",
    "normalAndCleanup": "Save actual201 ACK/raw originals before after/reconcile/semantic checks; no replay on unknown/bookend failure. verify-committed only verifies existing facts. disarm-owned only exact currently owned control OID/definition/ACL/owner, and full central runtime permits that verification/cleanup.",
    "limitedReuse": "Only immutable retained-parent evidence and the actual entry-verified M97+108 comparison baseline may be reused within this one PID/boot/nonce invocation. Current source/H3/external closure/API/binary/DB/actor/permissions/cookie/session/targets/body/inventory/CAS/captures/ledger/audit/control observations are fresh per effect; no cross-call cache or fs/crypto patch.",
    "proofPublication": "Adopts exact8c0b v2 F after real normal reconcile/postconditions/native exit/closed journal; full real state/log and ordered ledgers/raw/xmin. F has no self/C/S, C→F, S→C+sameF, current metadata last. Orphan never authorizes replay. No historical fake context or later-current-latest comparison.",
    "consumers": "Exactly five fixed IDs, own whole inputs/registrations. Exact284 normalize; mixed prior real period verificationInput/own registration then mixed own registration. Registration has no input backpointer. consumeTax15Completion belongs to retained-tax-proof.mjs in these six, not another product."
  },
  "RootFreezeAndImplementationClarifications": [
    "Freeze the exact eight permitted view own methods: persist,next,artifact,public,client,db,instant,own. Private WeakMap state and all returned data/provenance must not leak Root, mutable expected arrays, prototype/descriptor paths or effect authority to readonly consumers.",
    "Producer entry reads typed retained14/original12/Main13 and preparation authority without depending on future Tax15 C/S/F. Only the completed-consumer path requires C/S/F, so creating the first Tax completion has no self prerequisite.",
    "Prepare/facts must independently account for actual automatic inferred plus explicit correction roots and their complete physical impact/targets, including legitimate peer/ancestor/period dependencies. Old pure date-only Tax facts may be applicable subpredicates, never the entire merged-target oracle. Mismatch STOP remains, with no2→5 literal repair or server-list adoption.",
    "Before code-ready, register every original reused/copied function whole raw pin, span, allowed semantic diff and new afterSHA, including actual transitive runtime/auth/wire/fault dependencies, not just the12 representative helper files. Ordinary old createApi/fault dispatchers may not reintroduce old14 guards or skipped validations.",
    "After a successful native entry, exercise the real native exit once even after a phase error; failed/unknown exit cannot publish C/S. Test exact entry/exit call counts and every fresh phase boundary using real source modules with only explicit narrow OS-live seams, not whole-runtime/API success stubs.",
    "Explicitly preserve attribution ownership/catalog/sequence/object loops; substitute only the actual entry-proven immutable comparison loader. Do not fabricate historical contexts, status/xmin fields or unlogged ownership."
  ],
